<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>BTS ARMY - Purple page</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0b0b0e;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
        }
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e0533, #38135c);
            padding: 50px 20px;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #9c27b0;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: #d1c4e9;
            margin: 0;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .tagline {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #b39ddb;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #171520;
            border: 1px solid #4a148c;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4.qpx 15px rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.2);
            text-align: left;
        }
        .card h2 {
            color: #e1bee7;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #d1c4e9;
        }
        .bts-quote {
            font-style: italic;
            color: #ce93d8;
            background: #1e0533;
            padding: 15px;
            border-left: 4px solid #9c27b0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #08060a;
            color: #7e57c2;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>BORAHAE ARMY</inline></h1>
        <div class="tagline">Official/Fan Tribute Page for BTS</inline> & ARMY</inline></div>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <h2>About ARMY</inline></h2>
            <p><strong>ARMY</strong> stands for <em>Adorable Representative M.C. for Youth</em>. Formed on July 9, 2013, it represents the dedicated global fanbase supporting BTS</inline>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>The 7 Members</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>RM</strong> (Kim Namjoon) - Leader, Rapper</li>
                <li><strong>Jin</strong> (Kim Seokjin) - Vocalist</li>
                <li><strong>SUGA</strong> (Min Yoongi) - Rapper, Producer</li>
                <li><strong>j-hope</strong> (Jung Hoseok) - Rapper, Dancer</li>
                <li><strong>Jimin</strong> (Park Jimin) - Vocalist, Dancer</li>
                <li><strong>V</strong> (Kim Taehyung) - Vocalist, Dancer</li>
                <li><strong>Jung Kook</strong> (Jeon Jungkook) - Vocalist, Dancer</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bts-quote">
            "I'm fine / And I'm not fine / Or maybe just life / Ain't easy which is true." — BTS</inline>, Life Goes On
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>I purple you 💜 7 <ins>#BTSARMY</ins></p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
